                <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Verified drivers trained in highest safety standards.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover-lift">
                <img src="~/images/paywoo/ts10.jpg" alt="reliability" class="w-full h-32 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">High reliability</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2">Comfortable, well-maintained buses always on time.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover-lift">
                <img src="~/images/paywoo/ts11.jpg" alt="dedicated support" class="w-full h-32 object-cover rounded-xl mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Dedicated support</h3>
