            <div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0a2942]">TRTS INFRASTRUCTURE</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Modern TSRTC stations with high footfall for strategic ad placement</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-md hover-lift flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start">
            <img src="~/images/paywoo/ts14.jpg" alt="citilink bus" class="w-full sm:w-40 h-28 object-cover rounded-xl">
            <div><h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#0a2942]">Hyd CITILINK TRTS</h3><p class="text-gray-600 mt-2">Modern TSRTC buses connecting Hyderabad with premium advertising space</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-gray-100 shadow-md hover-lift flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start">
