    <div class="mt-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1f3a5f] to-[#2b5580] text-white p-8 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-xl">
        <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light"><i class="fas fa-phone-alt mr-3"></i> Turn daily commutes into high-impact brand impressions – <span class="font-bold text-amber-200">Call Us: +91 9652724937</span></p>
    </div>
</section>

